***INCLUDE MV45ATOP_HEADER_TEXT_DATA .

CONSTANTS: TEXT_LINE_LENGTH TYPE I VALUE 72,
           DYNPRO_WITH_TEC    LIKE SY-DYNNR VALUE 4402,
           DYNPRO_WITHOUT_TEC LIKE SY-DYNNR VALUE 4400.

* Betriebssystemtyp (für FB 'WS_QUERY')
DATA: SYSTEMTYP(4) TYPE C.

* Texttabelle deklarieren
TYPES: BEGIN OF TEXT_TABLE_STRUCT,
         LINE(TEXT_LINE_LENGTH) TYPE C,
       END OF TEXT_TABLE_STRUCT,
       TEXT_TABLE_TYPE(TEXT_LINE_LENGTH) TYPE C OCCURS 0.

* Tabelle
DATA:  TEXT_TABLE TYPE TEXT_TABLE_TYPE.

* Kopfgruppen, in denen das Text Control Dynpro vorkommt
DATA: KGTAB LIKE TVAK-KOPGR OCCURS 1 WITH HEADER LINE.

* Daten für den Aufruf des Text Control
DATA: TEXT_EDITOR TYPE REF TO C_TEXTEDIT_CONTROL.
DATA: TEXT_OK_CODE LIKE SY-UCOMM.
DATA: TEXT_REPID LIKE SY-REPID.
DATA: TEXT_CONTAINER(30) TYPE C VALUE 'TEXT_CONTROL'.
DATA: TEXT_CONTROL_DYNNR LIKE SY-DYNNR.
DATA: TEXT_CONTROL_AVAILABLE VALUE 'X'.
DATA: TEXT_CONTROL_READY_FOR_INPUT VALUE 'X'.
DATA: TEXT_CONTROL_REFERIERT VALUE SPACE.